                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "47d4f663-1217-3132-96b8-7808e9de195f",
                        "entry_id": "f8e8500f-53aa-32db-bcc2-62a433823d96",
                        "glosses": [
                            "zonder enig medeleven"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d891627c-fe75-4669-8799-6f62fb0d73ce",
                                "sense_id": "47d4f663-1217-3132-96b8-7808e9de195f",
                                "text": "`Imke Brandsma is ook zonder verf beeldschoon. Ik vind het onhartelijk hoe je over haar praat. Je moet mensen een kans geven.'"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c3c0b92-94ea-3301-a777-6a2d33f18b5d",
                        "entry_id": "f8e8500f-53aa-32db-bcc2-62a433823d96",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een onvriendelijke manier een gast ontvangen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98f43804-9eb3-436f-ac2f-d757a16a8b4b",
                                "sense_id": "9c3c0b92-94ea-3301-a777-6a2d33f18b5d",
                                "text": "Ongeveer honderd demonstranten, meer stonden de autoriteiten niet toe, vertrokken omstreeks 17.00 uur naar vliegveld Beek om de Amerikaanse president een „onhartelijk welkom\" te heten. Als Bush zal landen, wordt hij verwelkomd door een lawaaiprotest. De andere actievoerders gaan in een demonstratieve optocht naar het gebouw van de Coöperatie Cehave Landbouwbelang in Maastricht."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6c71237f-0a50-39be-becd-5dc435bf1615",
                        "entry_id": "f8e8500f-53aa-32db-bcc2-62a433823d96",
                        "glosses": [
                            "kil en onpersoonlijk"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31cdd49b-8cad-4de4-9942-5846d1e09264",
                                "sense_id": "6c71237f-0a50-39be-becd-5dc435bf1615",
                                "text": "In het gebouw overheerst een nietszeggende en monotone schakering aan grijstinten, hetgeen een afstandelijk en onhartelijk voorkomen biedt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60b34736-00b2-4f6a-8966-0aacb1f0f131",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8e8500f-53aa-32db-bcc2-62a433823d96",
                        "source_sense_description": "onvriendelijk",
                        "target_lang_word": "unfriendly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unfriendly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8adc53d8-0c05-3513-8556-ff60a5a5402a",
                                        "entry_id": "68e84966-cfe1-34ea-b25d-63f3260da9ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not friendly; hostile; mean."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d59c45a9-b769-445f-b7b1-49634a3eb2a8",
                                                "sense_id": "8adc53d8-0c05-3513-8556-ff60a5a5402a",
                                                "text": "Shrekkies will notice that the musical is going off-piste from the film right from the start when the curtain rises to reveal a seven-year-old Shrek turfed out into an unfriendly world by his parents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba625882-6d1b-4027-88c0-0f015dc87121",
                                                "sense_id": "8adc53d8-0c05-3513-8556-ff60a5a5402a",
                                                "text": "The reputations of our universities and our research base are already under threat because of the fallout from the EU referendum result, which is making the UK an unfriendlier place for overseas scholars and students, as well as cutting off access to an important stream of research funding and to a vibrant and well-developed ecosystem for collaborative work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "809878df-90c3-40a9-a31b-395dc387c87f",
                                                "sense_id": "8adc53d8-0c05-3513-8556-ff60a5a5402a",
                                                "text": "I thought of him as a young man in Washington for the first time, first job with McCarthy, and that that was probably one of the unfriendliest spaces at the time for a gay person."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "375dbc40-510b-3b97-b45c-ecb3249669b4",
                                        "entry_id": "68e84966-cfe1-34ea-b25d-63f3260da9ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unfavourable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unfriendly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f172228-b417-33aa-970d-f47e52e972c3",
                                        "entry_id": "46c151eb-2a43-3dbf-a2ed-53ae328d6540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An enemy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0152353b-b5aa-4012-9183-547f231baa37",
                                                "sense_id": "1f172228-b417-33aa-970d-f47e52e972c3",
                                                "text": "Sweep the valley compound and eliminate any unfriendlies you encounter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad5f1d13-ca39-407f-97a1-1e90d3b644a9",
                                                "sense_id": "1f172228-b417-33aa-970d-f47e52e972c3",
                                                "text": "You see, the mission of almost every teenage girl on the loose is to first identify the targets, just like a war. These include the primary objective (the boy), the enemy (other girls), the friendlies (sympathetic girl friends and the boy's family), and unfriendlies (other boys)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unfriendly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6b98493-c1df-3fba-9aa6-20b8e77490ab",
                                        "entry_id": "ea57e7b5-6861-3805-bbeb-8b19430bdd1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in an unkind or unfriendly manner; not as a friend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a72c9d85-28e2-48bf-8c1b-58738ec7df43",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8e8500f-53aa-32db-bcc2-62a433823d96",
                        "source_sense_description": "onvriendelijk",
                        "target_lang_word": "unkind",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unkind",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "593f9f77-ce72-38f2-85b8-37329a5efde4",
                                        "entry_id": "08470199-2931-3dae-b23d-48c8507c1f71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking kindness, sympathy, benevolence, gratitude, or similar; cruel, harsh or unjust; ungrateful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b31f6157-8b3e-4263-8a48-2d6e2288ee35",
                                                "sense_id": "593f9f77-ce72-38f2-85b8-37329a5efde4",
                                                "text": "Judge, O you gods, how dearly Caesar loved him!\nThis was the most unkindest cut of all;\nFor when the noble Caesar saw him stab,\nIngratitude, more strong than traitors’ arms,\nQuite vanquish’d him: then burst his mighty heart;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0515aeb7-e353-41fd-ae1a-dbaba68b0d60",
                                                "sense_id": "593f9f77-ce72-38f2-85b8-37329a5efde4",
                                                "text": "Yet was it ne’er my Fate, from thee to find\nA Deed ungentle, or a Word unkind:\nWhen others curst the Auth’ress of their Woe,\nThy Pity check’d my Sorrows in their Flow:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d48a8a61-e84f-4426-b5dc-273241ae86f9",
                                                "sense_id": "593f9f77-ce72-38f2-85b8-37329a5efde4",
                                                "text": "Nobody meant to be unkind, but nobody put themselves out of their way to secure her comfort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed688510-7ac5-4efb-9b59-1d02d98f2f01",
                                                "sense_id": "593f9f77-ce72-38f2-85b8-37329a5efde4",
                                                "text": "Despite the bursitis, Dewey got in a good round of golf, though his cautious game inspired a reporter to make one of the week′s unkindest remarks: “He plays golf like he plays politics — straight down the middle, and short.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b622f28-e2b0-4215-8ae0-6daf86f023db",
                                                "sense_id": "593f9f77-ce72-38f2-85b8-37329a5efde4",
                                                "text": "We had to learn that to refuse such gifts, which represented serious sacrifice, was more unkind than to accept them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "416d4f9e-27f6-4bf1-807d-35f25b51640c",
                                                "sense_id": "593f9f77-ce72-38f2-85b8-37329a5efde4",
                                                "text": "In the strictness with which he holds this view he belongs in the company of the novelists I have cited, except that he is unkinder and less charitable than they are."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bcc4dc9-ed6d-4b54-bdeb-d363881af939",
                                                "sense_id": "593f9f77-ce72-38f2-85b8-37329a5efde4",
                                                "text": "As a kid, I suffered the slings and arrows that most of us with such foreign names grow up with. I was called Pollock, Pockrock and worse. One unkind kid on the playground, perhaps sensing some need for attention, labeled me Peacock."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd6991fd-a6d5-3877-8f0b-624ccf0613bf",
                                        "entry_id": "08470199-2931-3dae-b23d-48c8507c1f71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not kind; contrary to nature or type; unnatural."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa9df043-0724-4fed-8f23-92a9769995ac",
                                                "sense_id": "bd6991fd-a6d5-3877-8f0b-624ccf0613bf",
                                                "text": "[…] A Feauer is an vnkinde heate, that commeth out of the heart, and passeth into all the members of the bodye, and grieueth the working of the bodye."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5210edb-fe32-4a0d-ae87-1d53a5a955ef",
                                                "sense_id": "bd6991fd-a6d5-3877-8f0b-624ccf0613bf",
                                                "text": "Crowes will not feed their yong til 9. daies old,\nBecause their vnkind colour makes them doubt\nThem to be theirs;"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25dd4bc3-f183-3194-b0e7-e72317f90c98",
                                        "entry_id": "08470199-2931-3dae-b23d-48c8507c1f71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having no race or kindred; childless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d133556e-55be-4a07-a43c-daed85e4d19a",
                                                "sense_id": "25dd4bc3-f183-3194-b0e7-e72317f90c98",
                                                "text": "O, had thy mother borne so hard a mind,\nShe had not brought forth thee, but died unkind."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb9de095-5f8f-42d8-a77c-5e4c1a9a3723",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8e8500f-53aa-32db-bcc2-62a433823d96",
                        "source_sense_description": "onvriendelijk",
                        "target_lang_word": "impolite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "impolite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37e45fb6-2e18-3de2-96cc-973ddf1a8066",
                                        "entry_id": "a238dd68-43f4-3ad7-84f1-250cf176fc8c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not polite; discourteous; not of polished manners; wanting in good manners."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e0e9236-6b0d-4787-b485-5aaf94ae34db",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8e8500f-53aa-32db-bcc2-62a433823d96",
                        "source_sense_description": "onvriendelijk",
                        "target_lang_word": "unpleasant",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unpleasant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06ae7bbe-0a1f-31a7-9306-8eb3b6d14c71",
                                        "entry_id": "9e4f7afd-2158-390d-90ea-d8883e7b0f27",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not pleasant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abcc2226-55b6-44d9-9e86-074bb71c2ea3",
                                                "sense_id": "06ae7bbe-0a1f-31a7-9306-8eb3b6d14c71",
                                                "text": "O sweet Portia,\nHere are a few of the unpleasant’st words\nThat ever blotted paper!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9e1ff6c-c9b4-4868-9a0d-5b60c4257ad7",
                                                "sense_id": "06ae7bbe-0a1f-31a7-9306-8eb3b6d14c71",
                                                "text": "It was indeed one admirable piece of Conduct in the said Magistrates, that the Streets were kept constantly clear, and free from all manner of frightful Objects, dead Bodies, or any such things as were indecent or unpleasant, unless where any Body fell down suddenly or died in the Streets […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c2b201e-f192-4f34-9874-638cf8864d55",
                                                "sense_id": "06ae7bbe-0a1f-31a7-9306-8eb3b6d14c71",
                                                "text": "The very circumstance, in its unpleasantest form, which they would each have been most anxious to avoid, had fallen on them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f3ebf4d-98e0-4acc-a7b7-5f80f783ef3a",
                                                "sense_id": "06ae7bbe-0a1f-31a7-9306-8eb3b6d14c71",
                                                "text": "[…] she had read several nice little histories about children who had got burnt, and eaten up by wild beasts and other unpleasant things, all because they would not remember the simple rules their friends had taught them: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ee519f6-1e2d-4d52-8cc0-d9504fdade6c",
                                                "sense_id": "06ae7bbe-0a1f-31a7-9306-8eb3b6d14c71",
                                                "text": "And I dipped into novels so like the unpleasanter parts of my own life that they might just as well have been autobiographies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85191eea-a186-4fd2-a5a6-2b14596e7345",
                                                "sense_id": "06ae7bbe-0a1f-31a7-9306-8eb3b6d14c71",
                                                "text": "An algae bloom has killed thousands of fish in the San Francisco Bay Area in recent weeks, officials say, forcing shoreline cleanups, spreading unpleasant odor and spurring scientists to further investigate the extent of the ecological damage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
